            <ArticleTitle>[Adverse reactions in metrizamide-meatocisternography (author's transl)].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>366-8</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>To avoid disantvantages and possible late reactions of oily contrast medium we performed 18 Meatocisternographies using the watersoluble contrast medium Metrizamide (Amipaque). Anti-convulsive premedication and clinical observance over a period of 24 h are necessary due to adverse reactions.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
